{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ removed this machine from the network %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 在%2$@把本机移出了网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld machines online": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld / %2$lld 台机器在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "22": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "22"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A machine lets this machine link to it once this line is in its `~/.ssh/authorized_keys`. The private key never leaves this machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这一行加入一台机器的 `~/.ssh/authorized_keys`，本机就能 link 到它。私钥不会离开本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加机器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a machine to join a network again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一台机器即可重新加入网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added, and still connecting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加，仍在连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another key is recorded for %@. Unless someone replaced the server's key, something else answers in its place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机为 %@ 记录的是另一把密钥。除非有人更换了服务器的密钥，否则应答的并不是它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorize it on a machine where you ran `gst up`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在一台执行过 `gst up` 的机器上为它授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorize this machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为本机授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the Login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改登录地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to the server…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在连接服务器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直连"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Down, trying again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已断开，正在重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the SSH login of a machine where you ran `gst up`. This machine links to it, and reaches every machine of its network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入一台执行过 `gst up` 的机器的 SSH 登录地址。本机会 link 到它，并由此访问它所在网络的每台机器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every machine drops its links to it and forgets it. It comes back only when someone adds it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有机器都会断开到它的 link 并忘掉它。只有再次添加，它才会回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fingerprint (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指纹（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is this the right server?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是你要连的服务器吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It adds this machine's public key to `~/.ssh/authorized_keys`. The private key never leaves this machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它把本机的公钥加入 `~/.ssh/authorized_keys`。私钥不会离开本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join your network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入你的网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joined through %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已通过 %@ 加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joining the network…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在加入网络…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last handshake": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近握手"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last seen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave the Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave the network?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开网络？"
          }
        }
      }
